<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="toc3">Neh.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehemiah Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="mt">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Nehemiah Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Nehemiah au Jewme Babylon baangketei gade cailigwang kelume ha rau jüja gwang gai. Nehemiah Persiame gwangpei, Artaxerxes piak kepwabe ta teikelade pütdi eh Jerusalem ga deuceudi teidi. Nehemiah 444 BC bekum Jerusalem ga miedi, hebaangme cailigwang kedi mmi 100 nage kedi caine. Nehemiah minadung Jerusalem rie retak kecu muiteu tei nah Ezra de si eh minadung muiteu teigai. Laisiukwak aika raukegai sam kenlang ge liecai Nehemiah dade au kekie ketei kenlang de.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Nehemiah herie retakdai kecu (1:1-7:3)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ezra kang gade likedi (7:4-10:39)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nehemiah mariem (11:1-13:31)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="s">Nehemiah kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />Aide Hakaliah napei Nehemiah samdung:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:1">Nah aide gwang Kislev bekei,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kislev bekei </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndaa Hebrewme lunar tingkum kepei ria gade peigai cai aide au Lütdi (Nov.) nah Kebam (Dec.) kakga da. Hegwangpei Artaxerxes I hegwang tei kecu tingdau. Cf. 2:1; 5:14. </char></note> Hegwangpei Artaxerxes hegwang tei kelu mmi ngkai bekum, Ih akatei kengking reketbam Susa ga bam. <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" />Nah Hanani, a siname ge, pa nah minadung Judah gade gwanglu. Nah Ih penuide Jerusalem ha, nah hebaang gade bang kelumedung, Jewme pak kelumedung ha keteugai.<verse eid="NEH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" />Nah penui a dage rangdi, “Bang kenzeume, cika Judah deuceu ga hebaang gade bang pwa kelame, kehereisüt bam nah masipei ma. Nah Jerusalem kirie kaudi, nah heriekidung mi le rudi.”<verse eid="NEH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />Nah cinzwa eh, Ih aipau sam dungde siu luge, Ih ntum mielwe hapdi, nah Ih tingba kekiee ge a suisia ladi. Nah Ih tinggim Tinggwang dwade mmwang nah kekie tei bamdi. <verse eid="NEH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" />Nah Ih rangdi, “Ah! RAMPAUBO, tinggim Tinggwang, ditube nah ngaukehing Tinggwang, samkakkelu samsang pecu ku kelamede nah pe ajadung de mzai kelame dade samkakde kaizeu kelabe. <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" />Ngaunggia eh n kilabe kekie kwa kingnei gailo, Ih henai n dwade n kilame Israelme ziemne tingmui tingba kie kebamde pie gailo. Nah Ih Israelme anui n dage kemau tei kedidung mau pet gaila. Ih nah a paume kelak liede, anui kemau tei dida. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" />Anui n dage kesia ta teigai süt dida. Nah anui n kilabe Moses dage hezaidung, nah ajadung nang kai kebeu dungde mzailu meda. <verse eid="NEH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" />Kehereide nang n kilabe Moses dage sam kai kebeu dungde nsung lulo, rang eh, ‘Magade nnuikatei de masang luta dicai, Ih akatei nnuide heleuh keda kakgage teizang gai dizie. <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" />Dede nnui a da cailigwang dailu delwe Ih aja kai kebeudungde mzailu nah teilu cai, nnui langgi kedimedung tinggim mdeitu ga bam liede, cikade Ih penuide hekwa luzie delwe a zi peu bam zielie Ih kedetkelu ni de gage penuide ngngwa gwang luzie.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 30:1-4</char></note><verse eid="NEH 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" />Nah penui n kilamedung nah n minadung da, nangne n kengking kedi nah n pumci le kelikelume. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" />Ah! A Rampaubo, ngaunggia n kilabe kekie de nah n zi rüt neu kela n kilame kekie kingnei gailo. Nah ngaunggia n kilabe de henai kengking peulo, nah pecu aipau peide dwa gade ngaugia peulo.” Cu a ziemne, Ih au hegwangpei ziemne hepiak kepwabe ge teigwang.<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s">Artaxerxes ne Nehemiah de Jerusalem gage langkegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />Nah aide hegwangpei Artaxerxes hegwang tei kebam mmi 20 bekum Nisan bekei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nisan bekei </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebrewme tingkum kepei ria gade cai Kezing (April) nah Keram (May) kakga da.</char></note> dau, zau pe dwa ga bam. Nah Ih zau de pwalu, nah Ih hegwangpei de peudi, nah Ih au pedwa gade a suisia eh bam ma.<verse eid="NEH 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />Nah hegwangpei acu keteugai, “Dai ziemne n suisia lano? Cu n ziemne au, nang au mra ma. Aide au madema helung siacu gwale.” Nah Ih au ngngi sütdi.<verse eid="NEH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" />Nah Ih hegwangpei sam keligai, “Peu hegwangpei de kelungta ringkelube tei lulo! A paume de kekung namdi de kaudi da, nah pe namdi heriekidung de mi ne ru msia süt dida, Ih daitei eh a suisia melu laino.”<verse eid="NEH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" />Nah hegwangpei a dage rangdi, “Nang dai luuneu lano?” Nah Ih tinggim Tinggwang dage kiegai.<verse eid="NEH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />Nah Ih hegwangpei dage ranggai, “Magade hegwangpei pe sui liecai, nah n kilabe n dwa gade petau liecai, acu peu Judah ga, a paume de kungpwa kebam namdi de ga mielo, nah Ih cide tei dailu kerane.”<verse eid="NEH 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />Nah hegwangpei hegwangpui pe taiga bam eh acu keteugai, “N beuh daidau kecang zieno?” Nah nang daidau cailigwang daizie no? Nah hegwangpei pe suilu, nah pa acu langgai, nah Ih pecu peting ranglia beudi.<verse eid="NEH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" />Nah Ih hegwangpei dage ranggai, “Hegwangpei pesui liecai, acu peu Euphrates Reuki kenlwetle deuceu deuceudime ziemne laisiudung peulo, iciu eh penuide peu Ih Judah ga kelüt ga kecang acu peu kahgwang lu kerane; <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" />nah Asaph, hegwangram hegung kekwabe dage de laisiu kailo, ciude pa acu kengking reketbam riekidung tsiadung kai kerane tsing peulu zie, cide ki ziemne, nah namdi kirie ziemne, nah Ih lungh kera ki de ziemne.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:8">Nah hegwangpei acu peu, Tinggwang acu ngngwa kelane. <verse eid="NEH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />Nah Ih Euphrates Reuki deuceudidung da gwang, nah Ih hegwangpei gu laisiudung penuide peulu. Nah hegwangpei reugwa kedime nah hekwen keteume de acu si eh langgai beu.<verse eid="NEH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" />Nah Horonme Sanballat nah Ammonme pei kedibe Tobiah aide siulu. Nah cide penai sui tazing di, Israelme ziuyi ziemne mige bata teizie lie eh gwang kebam de.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nehemiah Jerusalem rie pie kegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11" />Nah Ih Jerusalem ga gwanglu, nah Ih cika langcum ne bam.<verse eid="NEH 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12" />Nah Ih tingmui tetpet, Ih nah mina kiee kemak ge acu ngngwalwe mie nah Tinggwang Jerusalem ziemne teigai kera a lung tei kebeude Ih mige dage de ranglia ma. Cu ada makaune keda bam ma Ih cwa kela gada de rünne gwale. <verse eid="NEH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" />Nah Ih tingmui langkam herieki gade tetpet, neidi duirwak dwaga kecang, nah dung herieki ga kecang gwanglu. Nah Ih Jerusalem kiriedung pie twagwa gai, cidungde kau kebamde nah pe riekidung mi ne ru kedi de piegai. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Nah Ih Duirwak Rieki tetkah nah hegwangpei rejaai ga tetgai, dede cika a kaune tet kera ziemne heni gahdi. <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />Nah Ih tingmui wadi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Wadi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kidron Langkam</char></note> gade nghang keladau Ih kirie de pie twagwa gai, pecai tet caili delwe Ih langkam rieki ga gwanglu, nah Ih caili dailu. <verse eid="NEH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Cu cika kedime Ih daiga miebi nah daitei labi kecu cima. Nah cu ting kecang ga Ih Jewme, mede cingkume, mede makecime, mede namdi ga kedime, mede keda cika matei kebamme de made ranglia mereu.<verse eid="NEH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />Nah Ih penui dage ranggai, “Anui keherei kebamde nnui pie gailo, Jerusalem kaukedi nah pe riekidung mi ne rumsia kedide. Gwanglu eh anui Jerusalem riekidung teidai cugo, ciude anui ngngam bam sita dizie.” <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Nah Ih penui dage a Tinggwang acu ngha eh acu ngngwa kelade nah hegwangpei samdung pa a dage rang kegaidungde ndugai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:18">Nah penui rangdi, “Anui teicuh dai cugo.” Nah penui heta keyi tei kera ziemne mteilu.<verse eid="NEH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" />Nah Horonme pei Sanballat, nah Tobiah, namdi kedibe, Ammonme, nah Arabiame Geshem siulu, nah penui anuide henui teidi, nah penui anuide mneudi. Nah penui rangdi, “Nnui tei kebam aidungde daino? Nnui hegwangpei de ngngwa renia zeuni?”<verse eid="NEH 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" />Nah Ih penuide sam ge keligai, nah Ih penui dage ranggai: “Tinggim Tinggwang, pa anuide kengking peuzie, nah anui anuikatei, pe kilame, heta teicuh dai zie. Dede nnui ziemne Jerusalem ga nnui qwa, mede nnui mzeu, mede nnuide nsungla kera gede gah.”<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s">Herie keteime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />Nah Eliashib cingku kedibe cuhlu pe kangme cingkume de ngngwa lwe, nah penui meurün herieki teilu. Penui katei tei mcilu nah pe kikamdung kailu. Nah penui hai renei kecang nah Hananel renei kecang ga tei mcilu. <verse eid="NEH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Nah Jericho namdi minadung pecai be teilu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:2">Nah Imri napei Zaccur kirie pecai be dum teilu.<verse eid="NEH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Nah Hassenaah napeidung ne Heka Rieki de teilu. Penui ne hesumdung sumlu nah pe kikamdung, pe capdung, nah pe pakdung kailu.<verse eid="NEH 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" />Nah Meremoth, Uriah napei, Hakkoz napei, pecai be dum de teingkienglu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:4">Nah Meshullam, Berechiah napei, Meshezabel napei, pecai be dum de teingkienglu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:4">Nah Baana napei Zadok pecai be dum de teingkienglu.<verse eid="NEH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" />Nah Tekoa renam mena pecai be dum de teingkienglu, dede penui makecime penui mpaume ta dega penui ngha raudi.<verse eid="NEH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />Nah Paseah napei Joiada, nah Besodeiah napei Meshullam, herieki kehegwa de teingkienglu. Penai ne pe hesumdung sumlu nah pe kikamdung, pe capdung nah pe pakdung kailu.<verse eid="NEH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Nah Gibeonme Melatiah, nah Meronothme Jadon, Gibeon nah Mizpah mepei, penui ne pecaibe dum de retaklu, Euphrates Reuki deuceudibe kengking bam ga kecang.<verse eid="NEH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Harhaiah napei Uzziel, kecakkerekime, pecaibe dum de retaklu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:8">Nah Hananiah, marimkehengui keteime napei, pecaibe dum de retaklu. Nah penui Jerusalem herie kemza ga kecang tei hemi dailu.<verse eid="NEH 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Nah Hur napei, Rephaiah, Jerusalem deuzi piege reu kedibe, pecai be dum de teingkienglu.<verse eid="NEH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />Nah Harumaph napei Jedaiah pecai be dum de teingkienglu, pe ki dwa gade liede.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:10">Nah Hashabneiah napei Hattush pecai be dum de teingkienglu.<verse eid="NEH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Harim napei Malkijah, nah Pahath-Moab napei Hasshub, pecai be dum de teingkienglu Ovens reketbam si eh.<verse eid="NEH 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Nah Hallohesh napei Shallum, Jerusalem deuzi piege reu kedibe, pecai be dum de teingkienglu, pa nah pe napuidung.<verse eid="NEH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" />Hanun nah Zanoah ga kelunghme ne cabak rieki tei dailu. Penui katei teilu cide nah pe kikamdung, pe capdung, nah pe pakdung kailu, nah herie cubit cang ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">metre 440</char></note> Dung Rieki kecang teilu.<verse eid="NEH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />Nah Recab napei Malkijah, Beth-Hakkerem deuzi ga kedibe, Dung Rieki tei dailu. Pa pekatei teibam cide nah pe kikamdung, pe capdung, nah pe pakdung kaibam.<verse eid="NEH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />Nah Kol-Hozeh napei Shallun, Mizpah deuzi ga kedibe, Duilet Rieki tei dailu. Pa pekatei teibam cide nah cide tei ha di nah pe kikamdung, pe capdung, nah pe pakdung kaibam, nah Siloam jaai herie hegwangpei gurie ga David gu namdi gade pihidok kenghung bam ga kecang.<verse eid="NEH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" />Pecai, Azbuk napei Nehemiah, Beth-Zur deuzi piege gu kedibe, David rau dwaga kecang tei dailu, nah rejaai tei pwa bam cu kecang, nah kengkingme ki kecang.<verse eid="NEH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Pe cai, Levimedung Bani napei Rehum kangga de pecaibe dum de tei dailu. Hashabiah, Keilah deuzi pempiege reu kedibe, pe deuzi zi gade pecaibe dum de teilu;<verse eid="NEH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />pe cai, pe maame Levime ne, Henadad napei Binnui, Keilah deuzi pempiege reu kedibe pecaibe dum de teilu.<verse eid="NEH 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />Nah pecai ga Jeshua napei Ezer, Mizpah reu kedibe, reunetki ga kenghang mcwa kebam pecaibe dum de teilu.<verse eid="NEH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" />Pecai, Zabbai napei Baruch pecaibe dum de teilu, tangdeu kenreu gade cingkupei kedibe Eliashib kimui ga kecang.<verse eid="NEH 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" />Pecai, Uriah napei Meremoth, Hakkoz napei, pecaibe dum de teilu, Eliashib kimui gade Eliashib ki kamtu ga kecang.<verse eid="NEH 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Nah pe cai, cingkume, cabak ga kebammedung, ne tei dailu.<verse eid="NEH 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Pe cai, Benjamin nah Hasshub penai ki dwa de tei dailu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:23">Pe cai, Maaseiah napei Azariah, Ananiah napei, pe ki mbie de tei dailu.<verse eid="NEH 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Pe cai: Henadad napei Binnui, pecai be dum de tei dailu Azariah ki gade kenreu ga kecang nah kimiak ga kecang; <verse eid="NEH 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25" />Uzai napei Palal, kenreu de ncwa kebam gade hegwangpei ki nreube gade renei kebam kekwame bam tai de ga kecang teilu; pe cai, Parosh napei Pedaiah.<verse eid="NEH 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26" />Nah kerecaki ta keteime Ophel ga lung kebamme, Dui Reiki dwa gade petle bie nah renei kecang de teilu.<verse eid="NEH 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" />Pe cai, Tekoame pecaibe dum de teilu, reketbam kehu de dwa gade Ophel herie kecang de.<verse eid="NEH 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />Cingkume hekwen rieki nreube gade pecaibe dum de teilu, mige ge kecu pe ki dwa riep ga teilu.<verse eid="NEH 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Pe cai, Immer napei Zadok pe ki dwa de teilu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:29">Nah pe cai, Shecaniah napei Shemaiah, petle rieki kekwabe, teilu.<verse eid="NEH 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" />Pecai, Shelemiah napei Hananiah, Zalaph napei herokbe Hanun de si eh, pecaibe dum de tei dailu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:30">Pe cai, Berechiah napei Meshullam pe kibung dwa de teidailu.<verse eid="NEH 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Pe cai, Malkijah, kecakkerekime napei, tei dailu kerecaki ta keteime nah heli keteime ki kecang kengkwa rieki dwa ga, kimiak kibung nreule kecang.<verse eid="NEH 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" />Nah kecakkerekime nah heli keteime ne kimiak ga pebung nreube kakgade meurün rieki kecang de teidai lu.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s">Keretak de kencwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />Nah cinzwa eh, Sanballat anui kirie de teidai aulie kecu siu luge, pa deigadi, nah pe rata sütdi. Nah pa Jewmedung de keu henui teidi.<verse eid="NEH 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />Nah pa pe zangme nah Samaria reugwame dwade rangdi, “Kemnei Jewme aidungde penui daipai tei aulie cet lano? Penui namdi de penui ziemne teimcang dailu kera cet lani? Penui pum kaibeu zieni? Penui tingnaige gage teicanglu builie eh cet lani? Penui mimütdung le pwa tangtsudung teilu buini, cidungde ru kedi caine de?”<verse eid="NEH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />Ammonme pei Tobiah pe taiga bam. Nah pa rangdi, “Yeo, penui tsukwa hekwa kebam dega magade maiserung ge pereu ga nghang zie liecai, pa penui tsukwa kirie de tei ngkaudi lubui.”<verse eid="NEH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" />Dede Ih Tinggwang dage kekie tei, anuide nuinue kebamde ne, nah penui rangmsia kebamde peu penui peuga gwangdi lulo. Nah penuide tuiteu eh peu sangme deu ga hebaang teidi lulo. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" />Nah penui kemau tei kedidung penui mau gibeu so, nah penui maudung n dwade kemaigi diso, kedanemene penui anui heta tei kebamme dwade kii lalu.<verse eid="NEH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Cine anui kirie de hekwacuh, nah kirie pelane pempie ge gage keriangkeu cuhlu. Nah minadung heta tei kera lung pung bam kedine.<verse eid="NEH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />Nah cinzwa eh Sanballat, nah Tobiah, Arabme, nah Ammonme, nah Ashdod namdi medung, Jerusalem kirie tei cuhlu zeu delie kecu nah kirie ga ketiet kidung ngketdi zeu delie kecu siu luge, penui rata sütdi. <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" />Nah penui pelane ngngwa heciem riem bamdi, gwang Jerusalem de regi kera nah cide de tei kebwak gai kera. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" />Nah anui anui Tinggwang dage kekie teigai. Nah anui minadung de peu tingmui tingba penuide renia kerane kwa bamdi.<verse eid="NEH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />Nah Judahme suisiet leige teigai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 4:10">“Hepütdung pung kebamme kengking nnei dizeu da, nah cika kehera kieesüt bam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 4:10">Nah anui ziemne au, anui kiriebe hekwa gailak di zeu da.”<verse eid="NEH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />Nah anui ngauraume rangdi, “Penui cilak, nah anui penui kakga gwang eh penuide teitsetdi kemaktane penui ngaulak. Nah anui bata de tei mtak dizie.”<verse eid="NEH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Nah cinzwa eh, ngauraume taiga lungh kebam Jewme kegwang dau, penui anuida pia kerie ge rangdi, “Keheiga ge nnui nreugai liede, penui anuide renia zie!”<verse eid="NEH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Nah Ih kirie caiga heni kehena ga, mine kengau ni ga minadung de peu bamlu; nah Ih minadung de peu penui kingtiedung, penui hengeidung, nah penui lakpidung pwalu, delwe penui pautsa rehi gade peu bamlu. <verse eid="NEH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" />Nah Ih piegai, nah Ih cuh saplu, delwe makecime, nah kedime, nah mina pelane dage ranggai, “Anui ngauraume de hing so. A Rampaube au dai dige dibi nah hingbi kecu nsung lulo! Delwe nnui ramme ziemne, nnui napei nah nnui napui, nnui naudung, nah nnui kidung ziemne keregi lu.”<verse eid="NEH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />Nah cinzwa eh, anui ngauraume penui riempwa kebamde anuine cipwadi delie kecu ha suilu, nah Tinggwang ne penui riempwa kebam de ngamkedi cilu, anui pelane kirie teidai kerane, mina keheibe de pe ta ga cailigwang di. <verse eid="NEH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16" />Nah cinzwa eh, cipaunai gwale de, a minadung pempie ge bata tei, nah pempie ge, hengeidung, hegeudung, nah lakpidung, nah hekakrakcum pwalwe kwa eh saplu. Nah muiteume Judahme kilungme pelane cai sapbeu. <verse eid="NEH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17" />Kirie hekwa kebamme, nah penui ngha pelane peugai bata tei kera niadung pwa kecume de pe ba bage lam bata tei nah kedale ba hereunet pwa. <verse eid="NEH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />Nah bata keteime mina keheibe de pekia gage kingtie ge keupung kap. Nah hemeuseu kii kekwabe a taiga bam.<verse eid="NEH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Nah Ih minadung pelane nah penui reu makecime nah muiteume dage rangdi, “Bata tei hemisüt nah tei mdipet kedine, nah anuide kirie de ne, mige pe sinabe dade tsamdi nah mdeila dida. <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" />Nnui hemeuseu kii kwa de siude, nnui anuide cika ngngwa gwang ngkwalu, Anui Tinggwang anui ziemne regi beuzie.”<verse eid="NEH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Cine anui tingba ramsang tingcang nuge gade tingmui hegi pet kemaktane pempie ge kirie reuga bata tei nah pempie ge hengei pwa sap ntiprip eh kwa. <verse eid="NEH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />Aiciu eh, aipau tingdau Ih minadung dage ranggai, “Peu mipei nah pecu kenghame peciakne Jerusalem nam sumga gwang bam kera tingmui, delwe penui tingmui anui ziemne namdibe de kwa luzie nah tingna bata teilu kerane.” <verse eid="NEH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />Nah Ih mede, a siname mede a kilame de, mede mipei a caiga kwa kebambe de, migede anui painidung ra ma, mede dui sak kecudau migede pe reunet ra dima.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s">Nehemiah kegahme de kengha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />Nah mipeidung nah penui naudung sahbak gai, penui kangme, Jewmedung de ncam eh.<verse eid="NEH 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />Nah cika midungge rangdi, “Anui napeidung nah anui napuidung au kiee süt. Nah anui ciu keu lugo, ciude anui tyei nah ring bamlu kerane.”<verse eid="NEH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Nah cika midungge rangdi, “Anui anui luhdung, nah anui kubetsi luhdung nah anui kidung bamdo bam dida, iciu eh anui herakum kum kecudau ciu luilu kerane.”<verse eid="NEH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" />Nah midungge rangdi, “Anui anui luhdung nah anui kubeluh dungde hegwangpei raha ha kerane rangkanggeu releu dida.<verse eid="NEH 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" />Nah cu au, anui caihereibe pumteih de anui pumteih nzwada, penui napei dungde anui napeidung nzwada. Nah ainie, anui au anui napeidung nah anui napui dungde hebaang tei kera gage tuigai dida. Midungge anui napuidungde hebaang tuizwa dida, nah Tinggwang ziemne anui ba ga magede gah da kedanemene anui luhdung nah anui kubetsi dungde migu di delu.”<verse eid="NEH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Nah penui ncam kwadung nah aipau samdung de Ih siu luge Ih a rata sütdi. <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" />Nah a lung gade cetgai, nah Ih makecime dungde nah kedime de mlaidi. Delwe Ih penui dage rangdi, “Nnui pekai keu bam dida, nnui katei nnui kangme Jewme dade!” Nah Ih penui ziemne maadibe ngkwa qu hekwa gai.<verse eid="NEH 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" />Nah Ih penui dage rangdi, “Anui teilu kebui rehi gade, Jewme, anuikatei anui siname heleuhbe da zwa kedime dade lui caili dailu. Dede nnuikatei liede nnui siname de zwa la, nah anuine penuide lui caili dai bamla!” Ge penui mlei tadi, nah penui nzeu magede rang kera gahdi.<verse eid="NEH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" />Nah Ih ranggai, “Aide yi ma, nnui tei kebam tadung de. Nnui anui Tinggwang mie kehing gade tet kerabe meni, anui ngauraume, heleuh renia kebamde ziemne?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fq" closed="false">Nah Ih ranggai</char><char style="ft" closed="false">mede </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nah pa rangdi </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Delwe, Ih liede, a kibaume, nah a rehangmedung penuide rangkanggeu nah ciu releu beu bam dida. Kehereide, anui pekai keu kecude püt digo! <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />Kehereide, henai gage, penui luhdung, penui kubetsi luhdung, penui olive bangdung, nah penui kidung nah rangkanggeu haige de nah ciudung, zau keheci, nah nnui penuide maca releu keladung de penuide peucaili dai dilu.”<verse eid="NEH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" />Nah penui rangdi, “Anui peucaili dai dizie, nah anui magede penui dade kiedai lakta. Aiciu eh nang kerangde nzwa eh anui tei luzie.” Ih cingkume de qulu delwe Ih penuide aipau samde nzwa eh mneilu kera peu penuide sampetlu.<verse eid="NEH 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" />Pecai, Ih a pai kecunggai eh, Ih ranggai, “Ainzwa eh peu Tinggwang de nnui sampet de mnei kemak keheibede nnui kidung gade nah nnui mabam gade kecung gaizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nehemiah aide teigai kecu cau pe sampet de tei mzailu mebi cipaume de teigai kera rengei ge. Aipau ta de reset ge.</char></note> Nah ciciu eh pecu kecung gai eh peu magede bangbeu ta dizie.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:13">Nah hemaabe pelane rangdi, “Amen!” Nah penui RAMPAUBE de twagai, nah minadung aipau sam rehi gade teilu.<verse eid="NEH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />Judahme deuga acu penui gu kedibe tei kera pane kedet kelu benai gade, Hegwangpei Artaxerxes hegwang teikelu mmi ngkai be kum gade gwang mmi camreiekena kecang de, mmi kereiekena, Ih akatei mede a kilungme kedibe gu taktyei tyei ma. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Dede ndaa a dwale kedime minadung de teikeherei bamla, nah penui rangkanggeu shekel riakdai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Shekel riakdai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">456 gram kenzwage.</char></note> gage si eh ketyeipok nah zau de penui dade luu bamla. Cipau nreude penui rehangme kecangde mina reu kengking teu bamla. Dede Ih Tinggwang mie kehing gade, akatei cide nzwa tei ma. <verse eid="NEH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />Yeo, cipau nreude Ih a bata ketei aipau kirie gage kai nah anui au luhdung kette luima. Nah a rehangme peciakne cika makam ketei ziemne kangbau gai.<verse eid="NEH 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" />Cu au Jewme nah kedime mipei 150 ge de ngngwa a taktyei bam ga bam, anuide twagwapung kebam heleuh gade anuida kegwangme de si eh. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" />Nah tingba ramsangne lang beula kecube cai ketumseu ge, meurün mci kecube herok, nah nruinedung a ziemne langbeu la, nah lang kereine kakga zau ketsamtsam kekiee ge puinlim eh peula. Cine cide gade Ih deuceudibe taktyei de kie lama, kedanemene aipau minadung de keherei kecune.<verse eid="NEH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" />Ih n dage kie gaila, a Tinggwang, mina aide ziemne makeyi leune tei kegai de, acu nsung gailo.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s">Keretak de ncau si kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />Nah cinzwa eh, Sanballat penai Tobiah, nah Arabme pei Geshem, nah anui ngauraume kedame, Ih herie tei canglu delie kecu nah cika ketietki bamsi medelie kecu siu luge (cidau tingde Ih heriekidung gage kikam kai canglu mereu liede), <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />Sanballat penai Geshem a dage sam aide langgai eh ranggai, “Gwanglo, nah anui peting ge riemlwe Ono langkam ga renam ge gade gwang redau go.” Nah penai a dage makesia teigai kera cet bamdi.<verse eid="NEH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />Nah Ih penai dage samgwame de langgai, rang eh, “Ih bata kemlang ge tei au, nah Ih nghung daugai laklie. Daitie peu bata de mtak dilai Ih cide gidi eh nah nnai taiga nghung kera?”<verse eid="NEH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />Nah penai sam aide nzwa pia mdai langpwa a dage kaigai, nah sam aide nzwa Ih penai de samli beudi.<verse eid="NEH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Pecai Sanballat pegu rehangme de pia pe mengeibe a dage langgai sam aide nzwa, nah gum kemak laisiu ge peba ga bam. <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" />Cide ga ainzwa raupwala, “Nang nah Jewme kedame keregi kera cet bamlie kecu, heleuhdung kakgade siu eh nah Gashmu rang kecu au ciziemne nang herie de teuncuh dai aulie de. Nah aipau sam riade gadecai nang ne penui reu hegwang tei zielie zeu. <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />Delwe, nang Jerusalem ga caihakecime de nlum pwa bamlie zeu, rang eh ‘Judah ga hegwangpei ge bam!’ de eh sahgai kerane. Nah cu, aipau samde hegwangpei siu luzie. Cine cu, gwang eh anai ngngwa kempau lugo.”<verse eid="NEH 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />Nah Ih samli ge pe dage langgai, rang eh, “Magede cikenzwa ta teima sam aide nang rang kebamde rehi gade au, dede nang cide nkatei n lungcet gade mpwak kecuge da.”<verse eid="NEH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Kedanemene penui pelane anuide keheu eh ranggai, “Penui bata dungde gade mtak dizie, nah cide teicang luta dizie.” Dede Ih kekie tei, acu teingkieng beulo.<verse eid="NEH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />Nah pecai, Ih Delaiah napei, Mehetabel tsapei, Shemaiah ki ga lüt, nah pa tetpet mene bam. Nah pa rangdi, “Anai Tinggwang ki, kerecaki lung gade redau kera peting ge riet golie. Nah anai kerecaki kikam de ncap digo, kedanemene penui ncu teitset di kera gwangla delu. Yeolie, penui ncu teitset di kera tingmui gwangzie.”<verse eid="NEH 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Nah Ih rang, “Ih kenzwa mipei ge pakdi zieni? Nah cau, Ih kenzwage, kerecaki ga nlüt eh nah lunghlu bui ni? Ih lütlak!”<verse eid="NEH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" />Nah Ih cilu, nah piegai, Tinggwang ne langgai ma pecu. Dede pa cairasam rangpwa acu rangmsia, kedanemene Tobiah nah Sanballat ne pe zie lipwa pecu langgai. <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />Pecu aipau tade ziemne pe zie lilu hetau henim rangkang le, iciude Ih hingdi kerane, nah Ih cidungde teidi eh kemau teidi kerane. Nah penui acu peu hezi kesia ge punglu kerane, iciu eh penui acu rangmsialu kerane.<verse eid="NEH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" />Ih kekie tei, a Tinggwang, nsung gailo Tobiah nah Sanballat de, pe bata aidungde tei kegaide nzwa eh, nah caihakecipui Noadiah de de, nah caihakecime kedame acu keheu kelamedung de.<verse eid="NEH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herie teicangkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />Nah tingbazie riakngeiekena cai Elul bekei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Elul bekei </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebrewme tingkum kepei ria gade aide Mtei 2 (October) da.</char></note> zie ngkaiemengei benai herie pelane tei cangsiak lu. <verse eid="NEH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" />Nah cinzwa eh, anui ngauraume pelane siu keludau, anuide twagwapung kebam leuhdung pelane ngngi di, nah penui penui zu hengam le puipung di. Nah penui aipau bata de anui Tinggwang ne teigai lie kecu cilu. <verse eid="NEH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />Nah, cipau tingdau, Judah muiteume penui laisiudung kekiee Tobiah da langgai bam, nah Tobiah gu laisiudung penui da gwang bamdi. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Judah ga mina kekiee ge pecu sampetlwe kebamne, kedanemene pa au Arah napei Shekaniah napui nahpei. Nah Jehohanan pe napei ne Berechiah napei Meshullam napui de luu ludi. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />Cipaureude, penui a dwa gade pe bata keyi leune rang, nah penui Ih kerangbe pe dage paubeu ciau la. Tobiah acu keheu kerane laisiudung langgai bam.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />Nah iciu eh, kirie tei dailu nah Ih kikamdung pe bam gage kai kap keludau, recaki reketme nah leitei maame nah keda levime de kedetlu. <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" />Nah Ih peu a sinabe, Hanani penai Hananiah, kengking reketbam reu kedibe, de Jerusalem pie rengei kera nlumbeudi. Kedanemene pa au kenlum mipei ge, nah mina kekieege swa de pa Tinggwang mie hingki.<verse eid="NEH 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />Nah Ih penai dage rangdi, “Peu Jerusalem heriekidung tingnaimiak pet hemi sütdi kemakne ngkei helo. Nah penai sap kebam dau, peu penai de kikamdung de ngkui lwe, penai cidungde capdi maisia. Nah Jerusalem ga lungh kebamme de kwa kera kedetlu, mina be pebam ga, nah mina be pe ki dwa ga.”<verse eid="NEH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hebaang gade cailigwang kelume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />Cu Jerusalem namdi de au mzaha nah kedi ge, nah minadung kecam nage cika lunghbam, nah cika ki kekieege de tei dailu mereu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ezr. 2:1-70</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />Nah a Tinggwang a lung teibeu, nah Ih makecime nah kedime nah minadung de qu hekwa lu penui paupak rehi gade hezi raulu kera. Nah Ih cailigwang keraime paupak laisiukwak de ngaulu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:5">Nah cika raupwa kebam Ih ngaulu:<verse eid="NEH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />Deuceu ga mipeidung aidung de da, Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar ne langgi kedime, langgi kedi hebaang gade cailigwang kecume. Nah penui Jerusalem ga nah Judah ga, pekatei pe namdi riep ga cailigwangdi, <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />Zerubbabel, Jeshua, Nehemiah, Azariah, Raamiah, Nahamani, Mordecai, Bilshan, Mispereth, Bigvai, Nehum, Baanah penuide ngngwa kegwangme.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:7">Israelme peidung langgi kedi gade gwang kelume:<verse eid="NEH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" />Parosh namedung cai 2,172.<verse eid="NEH 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />Shephatiah namedung cai 372.<verse eid="NEH 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />Arah namedung cai 652<verse eid="NEH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />Pahath-Moab namedung, Jeshua nah Joab namedung gade cai 2,818.<verse eid="NEH 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" />Elam namedung cai 1,254.<verse eid="NEH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />Zattu namedung cai 845.<verse eid="NEH 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />Zakkai namedung cai 760.<verse eid="NEH 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />Binnui namedung cai 648.<verse eid="NEH 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />Bebai namedung cai 628.<verse eid="NEH 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />Azgad namedung cai 2,322.<verse eid="NEH 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />Adonikam namedung cai 667.<verse eid="NEH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />Bigvai namedung cai 2,067.<verse eid="NEH 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />Adin namedung cai 655.<verse eid="NEH 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />Ater namedung, Hezekiah gade cai 98.<verse eid="NEH 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />Hashum namedung cai 328.<verse eid="NEH 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />Bezai namedung cai 324.<verse eid="NEH 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />Hariph namedung cai 112.<verse eid="NEH 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />Gibeon namedung cai 95.<verse eid="NEH 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Bethlehem nah Netophah minadung cai 188.<verse eid="NEH 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />Anathoth minadung cai 128.<verse eid="NEH 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28" />Beth Azmaveth minadung cai 42.<verse eid="NEH 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29" />Kiriath Jearim, Kephirah nah Beeroth minadung cai 743.<verse eid="NEH 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30" />Ramah nah Geba minadung cai 621.<verse eid="NEH 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31" />Michmas minadung cai 122.<verse eid="NEH 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32" />Bethel nah Ai minadung cai 123.<verse eid="NEH 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33" />Nebo kedale minadung cai 52.<verse eid="NEH 7:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34" />Elam kedale namedung cai 1,254.<verse eid="NEH 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35" />Harim namedung cai 320.<verse eid="NEH 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36" />Jericho namedung cai 345.<verse eid="NEH 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37" />Lod, Hadid nah Ono namedung cai 721.<verse eid="NEH 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38" />Senaah namedung cai 3,930.<verse eid="NEH 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" />Cingkume: Jedaiah namedung, Jeshua leuhme cai 973; <verse eid="NEH 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" />Immer namedung cai 1,052; <verse eid="NEH 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" />Pashhur namedung cai 1,247; <verse eid="NEH 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />Harim namedung cai 1,017.<verse eid="NEH 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />Levimedung: Jeshua nah kadmiel namedung, Hodevah leuhmedung gade cai 74.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fq" closed="false">Hodevah leuhmedung gade </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mede </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Binnui, Hodevah gade </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Ezra 2:40)</char></note><verse eid="NEH 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Lei keteime: Asaph namedung cai 148.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ezr. 2:40-42</char></note><verse eid="NEH 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />Herieki kekwame: Shallum namedung, Ater namedung, Talmon namedung, Akkub namedung, Hatita namedung, Shobai namedung cai 138.<verse eid="NEH 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Kerecaki ta keteime cai: Ziha namedung, Hasupha namedung, Tabbaoth namedung, <verse eid="NEH 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />Keros namedung, Sia namedung, Padon namedung, <verse eid="NEH 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />Lebana namedung, Hagabah namedung, Shalmai namedung, <verse eid="NEH 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />Hanan namedung, Giddel namedung, Gahar namedung, <verse eid="NEH 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />Reaiah namedung, Rezin namedung, Nekoda namedung, <verse eid="NEH 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />Gazzam namedung, Uzza namedung, Paseah namedung, <verse eid="NEH 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />Besai namedung, Meunim namedung, Nephushesim namedung, <verse eid="NEH 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />Bakbuk namedung, Hakupha namedung, Harhur namedung, <verse eid="NEH 7:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />Bazluth namedung, Mehida namedung, Harsha namedung, <verse eid="NEH 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />Barkos namedung, Sisera namedung, Temah namedung <verse eid="NEH 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />Neziah namedung, Hatipha namedung.<verse eid="NEH 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Solomon kilame namedung cai: Sotai namedung, Sophereth namedung, Perida namedung, <verse eid="NEH 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />Jaala namedung, Darkon namedung, Giddel namedung, <verse eid="NEH 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />Shephatiah name, Hattil namedung, Pochereth Hazzebaim namedung, Amon namedung.<verse eid="NEH 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />Kerecaki ta keteime peciakne nah Solomon kilame namedung cai 392.<verse eid="NEH 7:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61" />Nah aidungde Tel Melah, Tel Harsha, Kerub, Addon, nah Immer gade kegwang medung, dede penui dai gade lunghgwang bi nah penui peime ki, penui Israelme leuh gade lie kecu penui rangmci luma.<verse eid="NEH 7:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62" />Delaiah namedung, Tobiah namedung, Nekoda namedung, cai 642.<verse eid="NEH 7:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63" />Nah cingkume gade: Habaiah namedung; Hakkoz namedung; Barzillai namedung, pa Gileadme Barzillai napui de pe nau lu, nah cipau zi dele pe pautsa zi teu ladi.<verse eid="NEH 7:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64" />Aidungde penui paume zi paupak ha raupwa kenzeu ga peei, dede cide ngau luma. Nah penuide cingkutaketei ga luulu tadi. <verse eid="NEH 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" />Nah deuceudibe penui dage Urim penai Thummin teulu kebui cingkupei bam kemaktane penui Tinggwang de recabeu kedi taktyei tyei gailak lie eh rangdi.<verse eid="NEH 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66" />Gwang kangbeu kelu peciakne, cai 42,360:<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:66 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">langgi kedime cailigwang kelu pumpei pelane</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67" />penui kilame mipei nah penui kilame mipui de ncüt kemak mina 7,337; nah penui, lei keteime mipei nah mipui cai 245.<verse eid="NEH 7:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />Hekwendung cai 736.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:68">Kwenceuna cai 245.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebrew laisiu yitubedung aipau dum de si lama. Aipau samria de Ezra 2:66 gade keu pwa bam.</char></note><verse eid="NEH 7:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />Utdung cai 435.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:69">Gadadung cai 6,720.<verse eid="NEH 7:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Nah kangge pautsa peume gade bata ga ngha beu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:70">Deuceudibe mabam gage kecak 1,000 darics,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:70 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kecak kilogram 8.6.</char></note> renet lidung 50, cingkume paini 530 pwapeu.<verse eid="NEH 7:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />Nah kangge pautsa peume gade mabam keteube de bata ga, kecak 20,000 darics<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:71 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kecak kilogram 170.</char></note> nah rangkanggeu 2,200 minas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:71 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rangkanggeu kilogram 1300.</char></note> pwapeu.<verse eid="NEH 7:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />Nah mina kebangme kecak 20,000 darics, nah rangkanggeu 2,000 minas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:72 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rangkanggeu 2,000 minas </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rangkanggeu kilogram 140</char></note> nah cingkume paini 67 pwapeu.<verse eid="NEH 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73" />Nah cingkume, nah Levime, nah herieki kekwame, nah lei keteime, nah minadung gade kangge, nah kerecaki ta keteime, nah Israelme peciakne penui namdi ga lunghdi. Nah kei hena bekei gwang eh Israel namedung penui namceu Judah ga bamdi.<verse eid="NEH 7:73" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="s">Ezra hezai peikegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />Kei hena be kei raitube nai, mina pelane maage tei eh heni kemza Dui Rieki dwaga ngkwalu. Nah penui keraube Ezra dage RAMPAUBE Israelme dage kai kebeu Moses zai laisiukwak de pwagwang kera ranggai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ezr. 3:1</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" />Nah cingkupei Ezra hezai de mipei de nah mipui dwaga pwa mpetlu, nah siulu kebui leune ngkwa kebam dwa gage, kei hena bekei zie raitu benai. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3" />Nah pa cide heni kemza ga Dui Rieki dwaga kebamde gade peigai, tingcang gade gwang tingna kecang, mipei nah mipui, nah siulu kebuime dwa gade. Nah Moses gu hezai laisiudum de minadung pelane kingnei sünne lu. <verse eid="NEH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4" />Nah keraube Ezra penui aide ziemne teipwa kebam tsingle teikelu bamra ga sapbam. Nah pe taiga, pe zetle sap kebamme: Mattithiah, Shema, Anaiah, Uriah, Hilkiah, nah Maaseiah; pe hilebie: Pedaiah, Mishael, Malkijah, Hashum, Hashbaddanah, Zechariah, nah Meshullam. <verse eid="NEH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5" />Nah Ezra minadung pelane dwa gade Moses gu hezai laisiudum de letlu, pa mina pelane reu kecehu ga sap kecune. Nah pa Moses gu hezai laisiudum letlu herizi, mina pelane cuh saplu.<verse eid="NEH 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6" />Nah Ezra Rampaube kedi Tinggwang de twagai. Nah mina pelane penui ba hwacuh lwe sam keligai, “Amen! Amen!”. Nah Rampaube de reca eh penui koktungmie hangdeu tunglu. <verse eid="NEH 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" />Nah Jeshua, nah Bani, nah Sherebiah, Jamin, Akkub, Shabbethai, Hodiah, Maaseiah, Kelita, Azariah, Jozabad, Hanan, Pelaiah nah Levime ne mina dungde hezai de rangmci lia bamdi. Nah minadung penui bam ga bam. <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" />Nah penui sünne eh laisiukwak gade peigai, Tinggwang zaide gade, nah pekie rangmci liagai. Nah penui pei kebamde ci mcilu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fq" closed="false">Nah pekie rangmci liagai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aide Hebrew gade pekie ci mci ma</char></note><verse eid="NEH 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />Nah Nehemiah, deuceudibe, nah Ezra, cingkube, keraube, nah Levime mina dungde rangmci lia kebamme dung, mina pelane dage rang, “Henai tingba au mci; cide nnui Rampaube Tinggwang ziemne. Nnui lung siaso nah hapso.” Kedanemene minadung pelane penui hezai sam dungde siu kelucai hapbam kedine.<verse eid="NEH 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" />Nah pa penui dage rang. “Miecu, maca tyeilu nah kekumbe saklu, nah magede telei nzeu kemakme de kesa pwa peulu, kedanemene henai tingba au mci, anui Rampaube ziemne. Nah nnui lung sia so, kedanemene, Rampaube suiyi de, nnui kengkieng delu.”<verse eid="NEH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Nah Levime minadung pelane de kaamdi eh ranggai, “Matu so, kedanemene henai kemci tingba lu. Nah nnui lung siaso.”<verse eid="NEH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Nah mina pelane matyei nah sak kera nah taktyei mzi beu kera nah penui renga gai kerane tetdi, kedanemene penuide ranglia kegai samde penui ci kelune.<verse eid="NEH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />Nah kei hena be kei pekenabe nai, mina leune pautsa peume, cingkume, nah Levime keraube Ezra da gwang ngkwalu, hezai samdung de pei kerane. <verse eid="NEH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" />Nah penui hezai dega raupwakela ngaulu Rampaube Moses dage aja kai kebeu de: Israelme de paiki ga lungh lulo kebeu kei hena bekei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kei hena bekei </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebrewme gu lunar tingkum kepei ria gade aide Kepai (Sep.) nah Mtei (Oct.) zieda. Cf. Lev. 23:39-43.</char></note> hengyi tingdau; <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" />nah penui kedame dungde depeu siu kerabelie de nah penui namdidung pelane ga nah Jerusalem ga paucang gailo de rang eh: “Lamlwa ga petcu, nah olive tsingkiakdung, maca tsingbangdung, nah myrtle tsingkiakdung, palm tsingkiakdung, nah tsingnei bang tsingkiakdung keugwang lu, rauteu kelanzwa, paikidung teilu kera ziemne.”<verse eid="NEH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Nah minadung mie tsingkiadung teugwanglu delwe mileunede pe ki reu gage, nah pe kisie gage, nah Tinggwang kigudung ga, nah Dui Rieki heni kemza de gage, nah Ephraim rieki heni kemzade gage penui kidung teilu. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" />Nah ngkwa kebam pelane, hebaang gade cailigwang kelume, paiki teilu, nah penui paiki ga lungh di. Kedanemene Israelme Nun napei Joshua tingdau gade cipaunai kecang ainzwa teilu kemak ziemne. Nah penui suiyi sütdi. <verse eid="NEH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" />Nah pa tingba ramsangne, tingbazie raitu gade kamtu benai kecang Tinggwang zaikwak gade peigai. Nah penui lang hena ne hengyi lu, nah lang heset ne benai hezai ga raupwa kelade nzwa eh hemaabe ngkwalwe kemci renet de teilu.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s">Israelme kemau kepet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />Nah pekei zie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pekei zie </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebreweme tingkum kepei riaga decai, aide October 31 da.</char></note> ngkaiemdai benai Israelmedung rosopai bahlu nah penui peu gage rebui pwetlu, delwe mmwang kera gwang ngkwalu. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" />Nah Israel leuh penui sangme leune dade mpet ntsamlu. Delwe penui sap eh, nah penui teimau kedi penui mau petlu, nah penui paume batadung gade teimau kedidung mau petlu. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" />Nah penui bam gade penui saplu, nah bamdakkak kecum ge penui RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang zaide peibak degai, nah bamdakkak kecum ge penui mau pet eh RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang de koktungmie recalu.<verse eid="NEH 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Nah Levime pihidok bamga Jeshua, Bani, Kadmiel, Shebaniah, Bunni, Sherebiah, Bani nah Kenani saplu. Nah penui RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang dage kekie tei sahbak di. <verse eid="NEH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" />Nah Levime, Jeshua, Kadmiel, Bani, Hashabneiah, Sherebiah, Hodiah, Shebaniah nah Pethahiah, mina dage rangdi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 9:5">“Cuh saplu! Nnui RAMPAUBE Tinggwang de twalu kelungta nah kelungta twalu! Nah peu penuide n zi kemdu de twalu, samlam nah hetwa pelane reu peu pe zide hetwa pung kelube tei lulo. <verse eid="NEH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />RAMPAUBO, nang rünne RAMPAUBE: nang ne tinggimdung nah ting ga hegidung nah tinggimgwame pelane teigai, kideu nah cika kebam pelane, jaaidi nah cika kebam pelane; nah nang ne ma pelane de kering peu; nah tinggimgwamedung penui keumie ncu reca la.<verse eid="NEH 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" />RAMPAUBO, nang au Abram de kedet kelube Tinggwang. Nah nang pecu Chaldeeme deu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Chaldeeme deu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Babylonme deudi</char></note> Ur gade ngngwa mpetlu. Nah, nang pe zi ‘Abraham,’ de msiaklu. <verse eid="NEH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" />Nah n dwade pa masang kecu nang ngaulu: nah nang pecu ngngwa samkaklu, Cannanme deu, Hittime, Amorme nah Perizzitme, Jebusme nah Girgashme deu pe leuhme de pwapeu kera; nah nang n samdungde tei luda, kedanemene nang au samsang kecune.<verse eid="NEH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" />Nah nang dainzwa eh anui paume Egypt ga keherei bi kecu ngaulu, nang penui nggia kiekegai kwa Jaaidi Kegie de gade siulu. <verse eid="NEH 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" />Nah nang Pharaoh <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pharaoh </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Egypt gwangpei</char></note>de marengei nah miswakegah batadung teilia gai, nah pe kilame pelane dage, nah pe deuga mina pelane dage, kedanemene penui n minadung dage daikenzwa gede penui zaisiabi kecu ci kebamne. Nah nang nzi teilu, nah cide henai kecangde bam. <verse eid="NEH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" />Nah nang penui miak dwa gade jaaidi de zina teidi, nah penui jaaidi sum gade kecang deu ga tetkah mpetlu. Nah nang penuide gwazui kelame de dui kecok ga nlimdi, tangtsukang ge dui kedi ga nlimmie kedinzwa. <verse eid="NEH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" />Nah nang ting kebaa dau hemwa gele penui lampui saubeu, nah tingmui mi le saubeu penui lampui tei mbaa eh peu penuide tet kera lampui pwalu kerane. <verse eid="NEH 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" />Nah nang Tinggim gade Sinai deutu ga nghunglu delwe penui dage marang. Nah penuide kesamsang tutiak nah hezai kesangbedung, hezai keyidung nah ajadung pwapeu. <verse eid="NEH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" />Nah nang penuide n kemci sabbath de peu cigai. Nah nang n kilabe Moses dage penuide hezaidung teimzai lulo peugai. <verse eid="NEH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" />Nah nang penui mzeu ge penuide tinggim gade tangku peu, nah nang penui hereu luge tsurakang ge gade dui lwapet eh peu penuide sak. Nah nang penuide peu zielie kebeu deu dega lütlwe gumlulo nang penuide rangbeu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:31">Jhn. 6:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />Dede penui nah anui paume ngangdi. Nah penui penui lung takdi nah n ajadung mzai tadi. <verse eid="NEH 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" />Nah penui siu laklie di, delwe nang penui kakgade n miswakegah batadung leune nang teikegai nsungtadi. Nah penui ngang eh muiteu ge de kedetlu penuide Egypt ga mi baang tei kera ngngwa cailigwang dai kerane. Dede nang au kemau gibeu kela Tinggwang, mide ngaunggia nah kula, n rata mneula nah n sampetdung ga samsang bam muila, nah nang penuide gidi ma. <verse eid="NEH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18" />Penui ziemne penui ketumseu mie ge teilu eh, ‘Aide nnuide Egypt gade ngngwa mpet kebeube nnui Tinggwang da,’ de eh rang, delwe penui ncu rangkemsia kedi teidi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 32:1-8</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19" />iciude nang au, n ngaugia kedi dene penuide hetaideu gage gidi ma. Pa tingkebaa dau penui lampui sau kelia hemwa penui reu kelade nah tingmui mi le pwa penui lampui tei mbaa beu eh penui ziemne tetgai kera lampui saubeu keugi dima. <verse eid="NEH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" />Nah nang n zaikeyi gade penui teimai kesiabe ranglia. Nah nang penuide peu manna tyei ta dima nah penui hereu kedidau nang penuide dui sak kera peu. <verse eid="NEH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" />Nah nang penuide hetaideu ga mmi riakdai peu ring lalu; penui magede teumai kesiabe bam dima. Penui painidung hak dima, nah penui pi teei eh mma dima. <verse eid="NEH 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" />Nah nang penuide peu heleuhdung nah hegwangramdung gwalu, nah nang penuide hangdeu petündung ga kecang kaipwa beu. Delwe penui Sihon deude gwalu, Heshbon ne hegwang tei kebam deude, nah Bashan deude Og hegwang tei kebam deude. <verse eid="NEH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" />Nah nang penui namedung tinggimdung ga hegidung kieege teingkiee beu. Nah nang penui paume dage sampet kebeu deude gage penuide ngngwa gwang beu hangdeu cide gumlu kerane.<verse eid="NEH 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" />Penui namedung lütlwe Canaanme deude gwalu, delwe nang mina cika lungh kebamme dwa gade penui reu ngkienglu. Nah nang penui ba gage, cipau hegwangpeidung, nah cika kelunghme dungde, peu penui keneura tei lukebui kengkieng peu. <verse eid="NEH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" />Nah anui paume hangdeu keyidung nah riekelu namdidung the tuilu. Nah penui makeyi leune pui kebam, tekwa kui kelube dung, kubeluhdung, nah Olive luhdung, matsibangdung kekieege kebam kidung gumlu. Nah penui tyei keneu leu tyei mnung lu nah penui luo petdi delwe nang penuide ma keyibe kepeu leune teu eh kehega lu.<verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />Nah penui nsam mzai tadi nah ncu mlaidi; nah penui n zai de penui caile ge kaidi. Nah n caihakecime penuide peu nda nreu cailigwang dailu kerane zierang keteime de penui teitsetdi. Nah penui kemau kedi teigai di. <verse eid="NEH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" />Nah nang penui ngauraume ba gage penuide kaidi, nah ngauraume penuide teikeherei. Nah penui keherei keludau n dage penui nggia kiegai, nah nang tinggim gade siulu. Nah, n ngaugia kedi gade, nang penuide kelibeu kerame pwapeu, nah penui ngauraume ba gade penuide kelibeu.<verse eid="NEH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" />Nah lungciep penuida gwang luge, penui ndwa gade kemau teidai di. Nah nang penui ngauraume ba gage penuide kaidai di, nah ngauraume ne penui reu teudi. Nah penui nreugwang ndage penui nggia kiegai, ge nang tinggim gade siulu delwe penuide pia kekiee ge kelibeu n ngaugia kedi de ziemne. <verse eid="NEH 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" />Nah nang penuide nreugwang n keledeusamdung mzai dailu lulo mrai ranggai. Dede penui ngangdi nah n zaidung mzai tadi. Nah, nang rangkegai samdung, penui cidungde kingnei ma, cide, magade mige mzai lucai, pa cidungde teu lungh zie. Nah penui n dage penui lung takdi nah ngang eh, kingnei raudi.<verse eid="NEH 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" />Nah nang penui dage mmi kekiee ge nlung tie gwang nah n rabe gade caihakecime lung teibeu eh penui dage mria ranggai, dede penui kingnei tadi. Nah nang penuide penui ngauraume ba gage kaibeu di. <verse eid="NEH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" />Dede, n ngaugia kedi gade, nang penuide ngkapdi ma, nah nang penuide gi dima. Kedanemene nang au mide ngaungia nah mide hungkela Tinggwang kecune.<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />Cine cu, anui Tinggwang, kedi, kengkieng, nah kehing Tinggwang, samkak kelude nah samkakkelu samsang kaizeu kelabe, peu n dwa gade anui keherie kegai pelane de peu kemta ge diso, Assyria gwangpei tingdau gade henai kecang anuida keherei kegwang, anui gwangpeidung, anui muiteumedung, anui cingkume nah anui caihakecime, anui paume nah n leuhme peciakne da keherei kegwang dungde. <verse eid="NEH 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" />Nah anuide saja kepeu leune ga nang au masang da. Kedanemene nang au samsang la; dede anui ziemne au, anui kemau tei sütdi. <verse eid="NEH 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Nah anui gwangpeidung, anui paume, anui muiteume nah anui cingkume nzai de mzailu tadi. Nah penui n zaidung penui lung gage kaizeu luma mede nang penuide mraisamdung rang kebeude n sam kingnei luma. <verse eid="NEH 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />Nah penui hegwangram gade penui n gwatei ma, nah nang n zaiyi eh penuide samlam beu, nah nang hangdeu keyi kemza penui dwa gade penuide pwa peu liede, penui kemau ketei gade nreu luma.<verse eid="NEH 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" />Ainie henai anui; anui au hebaangme ge dida. Nah nang anui paume de taktyei kepeu hangdeu keyi aika; ainie anui au, anui hebaangme teila dida!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ezr. 9:9, Hez. 28:48</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" />Anui kemau tei kedine hangdeube gade luhlüt kelube hegwangpei nang anui reu gage kai kebeube da gwang dila, nah penui anuide nah anui kauruine de teu penui sui teila. Nah anui au kehereisüt ladi da.<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Minadung samdaukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38" />Nah aidungde pelane teikedi ziemne, anui samsang eh samkak kelude raugaila, nah anui muiteume, anui Levime nah anui cingkume cika ge penui kaugiak giak gaila.<verse eid="NEH 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />Nah laisiudung ga giakkelu hezidung cai: deuceudibe Nehemiah, Hakaliah napei nah Zedekiah, <verse eid="NEH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" />Seraiah, Azariah, Jeremiah, <verse eid="NEH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />Pashhur, Amariah, Malkijah <verse eid="NEH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />Hattush, Shebaniah, Malluk, <verse eid="NEH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />Harim, Meremoth, Obadiah <verse eid="NEH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />Daniel, Ginnethon, Baruch, <verse eid="NEH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />Meshullam, Abijah, Mijamin. <verse eid="NEH 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />Maaziah, Bilgai, Shemaiah. Aidung decai cingkumedung da.<verse eid="NEH 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Nah Levime cai: Azaniah napei Jeshua; Henadad pautsa gade Binnui; Kadmiel; <verse eid="NEH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />nah penui sinamedung, Shebaniah, Hodiah, Kelita, Pelaiah, Hanan, <verse eid="NEH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />Mika, Rehob, Hashabiah, <verse eid="NEH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />Zaccur Sherebiah, Shebaniah, <verse eid="NEH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />Hodiah, Bani, Beninu.<verse eid="NEH 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" />Mina reu muiteume cai: Parosh, Pahath-Moab, Elam, Zattu, Bani, <verse eid="NEH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />Bunni, Azgad, Bebai, <verse eid="NEH 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />Adonijah, Bigvai, Adin, <verse eid="NEH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />Ater, Hezekiah, Azzur, <verse eid="NEH 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />Hodiah, Hashum, Bezai, <verse eid="NEH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />Hariph, Anathoth, Nebai, <verse eid="NEH 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />Magpiash, Meshullam, Hezir, <verse eid="NEH 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />Meshezabel, Zadok, Jaddua, <verse eid="NEH 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />Pelatiah, Hanan, Anaiah, <verse eid="NEH 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />Hoshea, Hananiah, Hasshub, <verse eid="NEH 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />Hallohesh, Pilha, Shobek, <verse eid="NEH 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />Rehum, Hashabnah, Maaseiah, <verse eid="NEH 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />Ahiah, Hanan, Anan, <verse eid="NEH 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />Malluk, Harim, Baanah.<verse eid="NEH 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28" />Nah Israelme kedamedung, cingkume, Levime, herieki kekwame, lei keteime, kerecaki kilamedung, nah kedame heleuh dade Tinggwang zai gade penuikatei de keuntsam kelame leune, penui naudung, penui napeidung nah penui napuidung, ci kebamme leune, cilu kebuime, <verse eid="NEH 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29" />Penui sinabe, penui makecime de ngngwalwe Tinggwang zai kilabe Moses dage kai kebeude nzui kera, nah sünne eh samkai kebeu pekiene, nah RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang pe samdung de nah pe hezaidung mnei kera sampet teilu; <verse eid="NEH 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" />Nah anui sangme anui deudi ga lungh kebamme de anui napui dungde peulak, nah anui napeidung ziemne anui penui napui dungde luulak; <verse eid="NEH 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" />nah, Sabbath benai mede kemci tingba benai, deudi taiga kelunghme dade luu lak, sabbath benai maniadung nah ciu ketsamtsam zwa kera teugwang de; nah mmi hena bekum de anui deu de taktyei lak nah hepau leune ngga beudi zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 23:10-11, Hez. 15:1-3</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />Nah, anui mmi ramsang kum anui Tinggwang ki ta ziemne hangge shekel zi cum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">shekel zi cum </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rangkanggeu gram mengei</char></note> gade zi ge peu kerane anui hezai ge teilu: <verse eid="NEH 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" />kemci tangku taktyeibam de ziemne nah mei reca peumui kera, tingba ramsang keru reca teibeu kera ziemne, sabbath, keici ngyi, hengyi kedadung ziemne, nah reca kemcidung ziemne, nah kemau recadung ziemne Israelme maudung keugidi kera ziemne, nah anui Tinggwang ki heta leune ziemne.<verse eid="NEH 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" />Nah minadung, cingkume kakga, Levime: tsing reca ziemne, anui Tinggwang ki ga cidungde teugwang kerane, anui pautsa ki ga ziemne peting siak dau mmi ge cai mmi ge eh, anui RAMPAUBE Tinggwang de recabam ga ru kerane, hezai ga raupwa kelanzwa anui dacakdung tei;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev. 6:12-13</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" />nah mmi ramsang, anui mei luhlüt kelu raitube nah matsibang leune gade petsi keikelu leune raitube RAMPAUBE ki ga teugwang kerane;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 23:19</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" />nah anui name neraibe nah anui kauruinedung, nah anui meurünna nah anui hemeu mciulu raitubedung liede, hezai ga raupwa kela nzwa, anui Tinggwang ki ga mata tei kebam cingkume de ngngwa gwang beuzie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 13:1-2; 22:29-30</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" />Nah anui teugwang beuzie: anui teikelu tokkui raitube nah anui recadung, nah matsi ketsam tsam pelane, zau, nah maca, cingkume ziemne, anui Tinggwang ki ga kai hekwa kecu kibung ga; nah kerei zige Levime ziemne anui deu gade lungh kelu meidung. Nah penui, Levime, penui ne namdi leune ga anui bata gu kerei zige luzie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rom. 11:16, Lev. 23:7</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" />Nah Levime kerei zige hekwa kecudau Levime Aaron dade lungh kehung cingkume de ngngwasi zie. Nah anui Tinggwang ki ga teu kerane, zi kerei teilwe zige Levime de peu kerecaki ga kai hekwa kecu kibung mabam ga teugwang zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pum. 18:26</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" />Kedanemene Israelme nah Levime kerecaki ga kai hekwa kecu kibung ga mine kepeu, ciu, zau nah maca, teugwang kaizie. Nah kerecaki ziemne lidung kainzeu siakte zie, nah cingkume heta tei kebammedung, nah herieki kekwamedung nah lei keteimedung. Nah anui Tinggwang ki de madaude gidi lak.<verse eid="NEH 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem ga kelungh mina keheime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />Nah minadung muiteume Jerusalem ga lunghdi. Nah mina kedame zikerei gade zige de Jerusalem kemci namdi ga lungh kerane dacak teilu, nah hekui de cai namdidung keda ga bamdi. <verse eid="NEH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" />Nah minadung mipei leune de samlam beu, heleirau eh Jerusalem ga lungh kerame dungde.<verse eid="NEH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />Nah deuceu peu keteumedung Jerusalem ga kelunghme aidungde da. Nah Judah namdidung ga penui lunghdi, penui mabam riep ga, penui namdidung ga: Israelme, cingkume, nah Levime, nah kerecaki ta keteime, nah Solomon kilame leuhme.<verse eid="NEH 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />Nah Judah leuhme gade nah Benjamin leuhme gade kangge Jerusalem ga lunghdi. Judah leuhme gade cai: Athaiah, Uzziah napei, Zechariah napei, Amariah napei, Shephatiah napei, Mahalalel napei, Perez leuhme gade; <verse eid="NEH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />nah Maaseiah, Baruch napei, Kol-Hozeh napei, Hazaiah napei, Adaiah napei, Joiarib napei, Zechariah napei, Shiloni leuhme ge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fq" closed="false">Shiloni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mede </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Shelani </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(1 Hel. 9:5)</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />Perez leuhme pelane, Jerusalem ga lungh kebamme, mina kemlangme cai 468. <verse eid="NEH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7" />Nah aidungde Benjamin leuhme: Sallu, Meshullam napei, Joed napei, Pedaiah napei, Kolaiah napei, Maaseiah napei, Ithiel napei, nah Jeshaiah napei; <verse eid="NEH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8" />nah pecai sui kelame, Gabbai, Sallai, mina 928. <verse eid="NEH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Nah Zichri napei Joel ne penui reu kedibe. Nah Judah, Hassenuah napei, caige namdi reuga kengkieng teu kebambe pe kenabe.<verse eid="NEH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Cingkume gade: Joiarib napei Jedaiah; Jakin; <verse eid="NEH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />Seraiah, Hilkiah napei, Meshullam napei, Zadok napei, Meraioth napei, Ahitub napei, Tinggwang kiga muiteube<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Muiteube </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cingku kedibe</char></note>; <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12" />nah penui sinamedung, kerecaki ziemne mata tei kebam medung, caige 822; nah Adaiah, Jeroham napei, Pelaliah napei, Amzi napei, Zechariah napei, Pashhur napei, Malkijah napei; <verse eid="NEH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13" />nah pe sinamedung, kelak peume, caige 242; nah Amashsai, Azarel napei, Ahzai napei, Meshillemoth napei, Immer napei; <verse eid="NEH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14" />nah penui sinamedung, mina kengkiengme, caige 128. Nah Haggedolim napei Zabdiel ne penui reu kedibe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fq" closed="false">Haggedolim napei </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mede</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mina kedime ge napei</char></note><verse eid="NEH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Nah Levime gade: Shemaiah, Hasshub napei, Azrikam napei, Hashabiah napei, Bunni napei; <verse eid="NEH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />nah Shabbethai nah Jozabad, Levime peu keteume gade, Tinggwang ki gwale mata pierengei kelabe; <verse eid="NEH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" />nah Mattaniah, Mika napei, Zabdi napei, Asaph leuhme, hetwa kepeu nah kekie ketei muiteube; nah pe siname kakgade pe kenabe, Bakbukiah; nah Abda, Shammua napei, Galal napei, Jeduthun napei. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fq" closed="false">Zabdi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mede </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Zichri </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(1 Hel. 9:15)</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" />Levime pelane Jerusalem kemci namdi ga 284 bam.<verse eid="NEH 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />Nah kerecaki reketme, Akkub, Talmon, nah penui sinamedung, herieki ga kwa kebamme cai 172.<verse eid="NEH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Nah Israelme kedame, cingkume, Levime, Judah ga namdidung leune ga la, hangge ge de pe mapwa ga. <verse eid="NEH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" />Nah kerecaki ta keteime Jerusalem sauge Ophel de qu kela ga lunghdi, nah Ziha penai Gishpa kerecaki ta keteime reu kedibe.<verse eid="NEH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />Nah Jerusalem ga Levime de pie kerengeibe cai Uzzi, Bani napei, Hashabiah napei, Mattaniah napei, Mika napei, Asaph leuhme gade, penui lei keteime, Tinggwang ki ga bata kerengeime. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" />Kedanemene hegwangpei aja penuide kaibeu, lei ketei muiteume tingba ramsangne teigwang kera zai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ezr. 6:1-12</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Nah Meshezabel napei Pethahiah, Zerah leuhme nah Judah leuhme, hegwangpei kangga mina maabe ding tei kebambe.<verse eid="NEH 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />Nah renamdung penui luhdung ga, Judah leuhme kangge lunghdi: Kiriath Arba ga nah renamdung; nah Dibon ga nah renamdung; nah Jekabzeel ga nah renamdung; <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />nah Jeshua ga; nah Moladah ga; nah Beth-Palet ga; <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />nah Hazar-Shual ga; nah Beersheba ga nah renamdung; <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28" />nah Ziklag ga; nah Mekonah nah renamdung; <verse eid="NEH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29" />nah En-Rimmon ga; nah Zorah ga; nah Jarmuth ga; <verse eid="NEH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30" />Zanoah, Adullam, nah penui renamdung; Lachish nah luhdung; Azekah nah renamdung. Nah penui Beersheba gade Hinnom langkam kecang lunghdi: <verse eid="NEH 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />nah Geba gade kegwang Benjamin leuhme Mikmash ga, nah Aija, nah Bethel nah renamdung, <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />Anathoth, Nob, Ananiah, <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />Hazor, Ramah, Gittaim, <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />Hadid, Zeboim, Neballat, <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />Lod, nah Ono, heta teikecime langkam ga lunghdi; <verse eid="NEH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />nah Judah tingdeu ga kelungh Levime midungge, Benjamin leuhme de nggnwa lunghdi.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s">Cingkumedung nah Levimedung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />Nah aidungde Shealtiel napei Zerubbabel nah Jeshua de ngngwa lwe cailikegwang cingkume nah levime: Seraiah, Jeremiah, Ezra, <verse eid="NEH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />Amariah, Malluk, Hattush, <verse eid="NEH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />Shecaniah, Rehum, Meremoth, <verse eid="NEH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />Iddo, Ginnethon, Abijah, <verse eid="NEH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />Mijamin, Moadiah, Bilgah, <verse eid="NEH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />Shemaiah nah Joiarib, Jedaiah, <verse eid="NEH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />Sallu, Amok, Hilkiah, Jedaiah. Aidungde Jeshua tingdau cingkume kakgade muiteumedung nah penui sinamedung.<verse eid="NEH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />Nah Levime cai: Jeshua; Binnui; Kadmiel; Sherebiah; Judah; nah Mattaniah, pa nah penui sinamedung ketwalei ketei pie kerengeime; <verse eid="NEH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />nah Bakbukiah nah Unni, nah penui sinamedung, penui ta ketei ga penuide ncwa bam. <verse eid="NEH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Nah Jeshua au Joiakim pei; nah Joiakim au Eliashib pei; nah Eliashib, Joiada pei; <verse eid="NEH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />nah Joiada au Jonathan pei; nah Jonathan au Jaddua pei.<verse eid="NEH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Joiakim cingku kedibe tingdau cingku aidungde pautsa peumedung: Seraiah pautsa gade, Meraiah; Jeremiah pautsa gade, Hananiah; <verse eid="NEH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />Ezra pautsa gade, Meshullam; Amariah pautsa gade, Jehohanan; <verse eid="NEH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />Malluk pautsa gade, Jonathan; Shebaniah pautsa gade, Joseph;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fq" closed="false">Malluk </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mede </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Meliku </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Hebrew Qere)</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />Harim pautsa gade, Adna; Meremoth pautsa gade, Helkai; <verse eid="NEH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />Iddo pautsa gade, Zechariah; Ginnethon pautsa gade, Meshullam; <verse eid="NEH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />Abijah pautsa gade, Zichri; Miniamin pautsa gade, Moadiah pautsa gade, Piltai; <verse eid="NEH 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />Bilgah pautsa gade, Shammua; Shemaiah pautsa gade, Jehonathan; <verse eid="NEH 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />Joiarib pautsa gade, Mattenai; Jedaiah pautsa gade, Uzzi; <verse eid="NEH 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />Sallai pautsa gade, Kallai; Amok pautsa gade, Eber; <verse eid="NEH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />Hilkiah pautsa gade, Hashabiah; Jedaiah pautsa gade, Nethanel.<verse eid="NEH 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />Cingkume kedime Eliashib, Joiada, Johanan nah Jaddua tingdau, Levime kelak peume ha raupwa bamla: cingkume liede, Persiame pei Darius hegwang ketei tingdau.<verse eid="NEH 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" />Levime, kelakdung peume, Eliashib napei Johanan tingdau kecang liede, heta keteidung laisiukwak ga raunzeu. <verse eid="NEH 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" />Nah Levime peu keteumedung cai Hashabiah, Sherebiah, nah Kadmiel napei Jeshua, hetwa nah herüt kepeu recadung ga penui sinamedung penuide ncwa kebamme, Tinggwang minabe David ne rang kebeu nzwa. <verse eid="NEH 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Mattaniah, Bakbukiah, Obadiah, Meshullam, Talmon, Akkub, aidungde kekwame, herieki kekwame, rieki taiga mania kaikenzeu ga bam eh kwa kecumedung. <verse eid="NEH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" />Mina aidungde Joiakim, Jeshua napei, Jozadak tsapei tingdau, nah deuceudibe Nehemiah nah cingkupei Ezra, keraube tingdau.<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem rie teikemci ta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />Nah Jerusalem kirie de tei mci kera dau, penui Levime de penui lungh kebam leune gade peeilu, penuide Jerusalem ga ngngwa gwang kera penui sui yisüt eh teikemci ta aide ketwa leidung nah mtwai, lyredung, nah leibungdung, kwa eh ngngwa hengyi lu kerane. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />Nah lei keteime kelakdung gwang kangbaulu, penui lungh kebam Jerusalem twagwapung kebam deu nah Netophahme de twagwapung kebam renamdung gade, <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />nah Beth-Gilgal luhdung gade nah Geba nah Azmaveth luh gade; lei keteime Jerusalem twagwapung kebam penuikatei penui ziemne renamdung teilu. <verse eid="NEH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" />Nah cingkume nah Levime penuikatei penuide teimci lu. Nah penui minadung, nah heriekidung, nah kirie teimci lu. <verse eid="NEH 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Nah Ih Judahme kedime de kirie peureu ga nghang kera qu hekwalu. Nah Ih hetwa kepeu leiteimaa maadi kena de kelang lu, delwe kirie peureu zetlebie Dung Rieki le ge tetgai. <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />Nah Hoshaiah Judahme muiteume pempie ge penui caisui eh tet, <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />nah Azariah, Ezra, nah Meshullam, <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />Judah, Benjamin, nah Shemaiah, nah Jeremiah. <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35" />Nah cingkume name gade midungge telui pwala: Zechariah, Jonathan napei, Shemaiah napei, Mattaniah napei, Micaiah napei, Zaccur napei, Asaph napei; <verse eid="NEH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36" />nah pe sinamedung, Shemaiah, nah Azarel, Milalai, Gilalai, Maai, Nethanel, Judah, nah Hanani, Tinggwang minabe, David lei ketei netdung pwalu. Nah Ezra keraube penui dwaga tet. <verse eid="NEH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" />Nah penuide ncwa eh Duireu Rieki gade, penui David namdi pihidokdung ga tet nghang, David ki kirie reuga tetkah eh kepetle, Dui Rieki ga kecang gwangdi. <verse eid="NEH 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Nah ketwa leiteimaa pe kenabe, kirie peureu hilebie miekela, nah Ih, minadung pempie ge de ngngwa penui cai suilu, Ovens renei tetkah mie kirie kemza ga gwanglu, <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />nah Ephraim herieki peureu ga, nah kehegwa herieki reu, nah heka rieki reu nah Hananel renei nah hai renei, cikade meurün rieki ga tet gwanglu: nah penui rieki kekwa bam ga gwang mtaklu. <verse eid="NEH 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Nah hetwa kepeu maa kena Tinggwang ki dwa ga saplu: Ih de, nah muiteume pempiege acu ngngwa bamlu; <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" />nah cingkume, Eliakim, Maaseiah, Miniamin, Micaiah, Elioenai, Zechariah, Hananiah, telui pwalu eh; <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />nah Maaseiah, Shemaiah, Eleazar, Uzzi, Jehohanan, Malkijah, Elam, nah Ezer. Nah lei keteime penuikatei siulu, Jezrahiah ne penui muiteu tei eh. <verse eid="NEH 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />Nah cipaunai penui ratak kedi teigai, nah penui suiyi le puidi, Tinggwang ne penui sui teihemi sütgai kebeune. Cipau reude mipui nah hename kecangde suiyi lu, ciu eh Jerusalem suiyi kwa mdei süt kecu kecangde siumie cangdi.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />Nah cipau benai makaidung ziemne, nah kereizige ziemne, pemmi gade mei nah matsi meupet raitube, mania kai hekwa kecu kibung ga peu mina dungde rengei kera kedetlu, hezai gade kie kela cingkume ziemne nah Levime ziemne namdi luhdung gade maha kekai dungde hekwa kera penui zie. Kedanemene Judahme cingkume reu nah Levime reu, sap kebamme de ngau penui suidi. <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" />Nah penui penui Tinggwang recadung nah tei kemci recadung teigai, lei keteime nah herieki kekwame de si eh, David nah pe napei Solomon ne ranglia kebeu nzwa. <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />Kedanemene ndaa David nah Asaph tingdau gade, lei keteime Tinggwang de hetwa nah herüt peu kecu leidung keteime kakga peube bamla.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fq" closed="false">Peube </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mede </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">peubedung </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Hebrew Qere)</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" />Nah Zerubbabel tingdau nah Nehemiah tingdau de, Israelme peciakne lei keteime nah herieki kekwame de ngha kerane tingba ramsang ma kai beula. Nah penui Levime ziemne kemci reca peu gai, nah Levime Aaron leuhme ziemne penui qwa peudi.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s">Nehemiah matei keheci kekambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />Cipau nai Moses laisiukwak gade pei sahbak gai, minadung dage, nah cide ga rawpwa kela ngaulu, Ammonme mede Moabme migede madaude peu Tinggwang mina ga si laklie kecu. <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" />Kedanemene penui Israelme de taktyei nah dui pwa redau kemakne. Nah pa penuide peu reset kerane Balaam de lilu, dede anui Tinggwang reset cide pwa samlam ge teidi. <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" />Nah cinzwa eh, Israelme hezai de siulu herizi, penui tingbung gade sangme peciakne de langgi di.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4" />Cu, aipau dwa gade, cingkupei Eliashib, Tobiah de kenname ge, anui Tinggwang ki maniakibung pie rengeila. <verse eid="NEH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5" />Nah pa pe ziemne kibung kedige teleibeu, nah penui recadung kaibamla cikage: marim kehengui; nah kerecaki netdung; nah ciu zikerei zige makai, zau, nah maca, Levime, lei keteime, nah herieki kekwame de tei lulo kebeu; nah cingkume de reca kebeudung. <verse eid="NEH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" />Nah aide aiciu kebamdau Ih Jerusalem ga bam ma. Kedanemene Babylon hegwangpei Artaxerxes hegwang teikelu mmi camreiekena bekum Ih hegwangpei da mie kedine. Nah pecai Ih tetkera hegwangpei dade keteulu.<verse eid="NEH 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />Nah Ih Jerusalem ga caili gwanglu. Nah Eliashib Tobiah ziemne kemauta teikedi Ih cilu, Tinggwang ki gage pe ziemne kibung ge teigai kebeu. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Nah Ih cide a suita zingdi, nah Ih Tobiah ki niadung peciakne kibung gade kelien mpetdi. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" />Nah Ih ranggai ge penui kibungdung tei mcilu. Nah Ih cikage Tinggwang ki niadung, recadung nah kehengui de si eh kai caili gaidi.<verse eid="NEH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />Nah Ih Levime de pe mzi peubeu kemak, nah heta tei kebamme Levime nah lei keteime, mileunede pe luh riep gage pakgai kedi cilu. <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" />Ih kedime dungde ngngwa repia, nah Ih ranggai, “Daitei eh Tinggwang ki de gidi no”? Nah Ih penuide qu hekwalu nah penuide peu penui bamga gwang bam dailu. <verse eid="NEH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" />Nah Judahme pelane kerei zige ciu, nah zau, nah maca teugwang beu mabam hekwa kibung ga. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" />Nah Ih maniakibungdung kekwame de kedetlu: cingkupei Shelemiah, nah keraube Zadok, nah Levime pei Pedaiah; nah Zaccur napei, Mattaniah napei Hanan ne penuide kenghabe tei. Kedanemene penui au masanglie la, nah penui siname dungde ma mzibeu kera penuide nlumbeu.<verse eid="NEH 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" />Acu nsunglo, a Tinggwang, aide ziemne, nah Ih Tinggwang ki ziemne tei kegai nah ngha kegai ziemne a samsang ta keyi de hemaidi helo.<verse eid="NEH 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />Cipau tingdau Ih Judah ga minadung sabbath benai kubetsidui tui bam eh ngau, nah minadung mei kekiee pwalwet eh, nah minadung gada reu gage hepwet tei kebam, zau liede, kubetsi, nah tangzüttsi, nah pe pwet ketsamtsam, nah minadung Jerusalem ga pwagwang Sabbath benai. Nah Ih aipaunai penui gu magede zwa helo de rang beudi. <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Nah Tyreme cika lungh kebamme heka nah ma zwa kerabe ketsam tsam teugwang nah cidungde sabbath benai Judah leuhme dage nah Jerusalem gade de zwabam. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Nah Ih Judahme makecime de kesiu. Nah Ih penui dage ranggai, “Daino aide ma kemau nnui teikebam de, nah Sabbath tingba de teihera eh? <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" />Nnui paume ndaa ainzwa teigai, nah anui Tinggwang kengkap aidungde pelane anuida nah namdi aikage kaigai beu meni? Nah nnui Sabbath teihera gai eh Israel reu gage rata teugwanggai si bam dida.”<verse eid="NEH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />Nah cinzwa eh, Jerusalem herieki mui nlüt kedidau Sabbath dwa, Ih ranggai, nah kikamdung ngkuidi, nah Ih rangbeu cide ngkei laklie de penuide Sabbath cang kemakta. Nah Ih a mina rehangme kangge de peu herieki ga sap kwalu; Sabbath benai magede teu nlüt luma. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />Nah heli keteime nah mania ketsam tsam kezwame Jerusalem namdi gwale piage mede piana bam dila. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Nah Ih penui dage mrairang, nah Ih penui dage rangbeu, “Daitei nnui herie dwaga kwa bamno? Nnui aiciu daicai, Ih nnui dage a ba kai dizie!” Cipaucai gwale, penui Sabbath ga gwang tadi.<verse eid="NEH 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" />Nah Ih Levime dage penuikatei penuide teimci lulo rangbeu nah gwang heriekidung kwa lulo de Sabbath tingba teimci lu kerane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:22">Aide ziemne de acu nsung gailo, a Tinggwang, nah n samkakkelu samsang kedi teu acu nggia gailo.<verse eid="NEH 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />Cipau tingdau Ih Jewme Ashdodme, Ammonme, Moabme mipuidung de ngngwa lungh kebamde ngau. <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />Nah penui namedung, pempie ge Ashdodme let rangdi, nah migede Hebrew let rang cilu tadi, dede mi kedame let rangdi. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" />Nah Ih penuide kesiugai, nah penuide resetgai, nah penui midung gede dap, nah penui peutam pai gidi. Nah Ih penuide peu Tinggwang zi teu sampet lu: “Magade nnui nnui napui dungde penui napeime de peucai, mede magade nnui penui napuime gade nnui napeime ziemne, mede nnuikatei ziemne lucai! <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" />Solomon, Israel gwangpei, ma aidungde ketei ziemne kemau tei meni? Dede heleuhdung kekiee kakgade pa kenzwa hegwang mide gah: nah pe Tinggwang pecu hung, nah Tinggwang pecu Israel pelane reu hegwang teibeu. Sangme puidung ne pecu depeu kemau tei. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" />Ciciude anui n kwa kingnei zieni, anui Tinggwang dage samsang mene aipau kesia kedi leune teigai kera, nah sangme pui dungde luu zieni?”<verse eid="NEH 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" />Nah cingku kedibe Eliashib napei, Joiada name gade hangge, Horonme pei Sanballat napui de pe naulu. Nah Ih pecu a taiga de langgi di.<verse eid="NEH 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" />Penuide nsunggailo, a Tinggwang, penui cingku tadung nah cingkume nah Levime ngngwa samkakkelu de tei hera kedi ziemne.<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />Ih penuide sangme zai pekiene gade teimci lu. Nah Ih heta tei kerane, mige ge kecude pe ta riep nlum beudi, cingkume ziemne nah Levime ziemne; <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" />nah keru reca tei kerane peting dau tsingdiak teugwang kera; nah meitsi pet raitu kecudung ziemne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:31">Acu nsung lo, a Tinggwang, keyi ge ziemne.<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>